<title>USA: Noland Q2 sales $117.7 mln vs $124.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Noland Q2 sales $117.7 mln vs $124.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS VA. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noland Co said Tuesday its second-quarter sales dropped to $117.7 million from $124.6 million the year before.</p>
<p>Noland said June sales fell to $39.6 million from $40.3 million in June 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The single biggest factor (for the slower sales) is the drop in air conditioning sales because of the cool spring,&quot; a company spokesman said, adding second-quarter air conditioning sales were down 13 percent compared with last year.</p>
</text>
